{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_14_level_main_14-04_end","groupId":"main_14","stageId":"main_14-04","title":"探查岩洞區域","storyCode":"14-5","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_14-04_end.txt","sourceHash":"874427871dccc8602dcf5a6f6148c59cd46007b14c420fe25722996b382471b1","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"W在與雇傭兵攜手戰勝詭異怪物後，隻身闖入了與赦罪師有關的古老遺跡內部。被俘虜的厄爾蘇拉抓住了時機，從赫德雷的手中逃脫。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"50_g18_originiumcave"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"長相恐怖的怪物","speakerId":"avg_npc_1335_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（怪異的嚎叫）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W小隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1336_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們的武器一點用都沒有！該死的……這怪物是死不掉嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"瞄準一點打！往它的腦袋上招呼！我就不信它能有多耐打！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W小隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1336_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它動作也太快了！根本瞄不準！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W小隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1336_1","isRemote":false,"text":"吸引一下它的注意力！我從它背後試試！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"想要偷襲的傭兵繞到了怪物龐大的身軀背後，怪物只是甩了甩尾巴，便將他摔到了岩壁上，輕鬆得就像趕走身上的跳蚤。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"連續的攻擊沒能對它造成什麼傷害，巨大的振翅聲響起，熾熱的風狂亂地衝擊著山洞裡的一切，讓空氣更加稀薄。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"土石震動，尖刺拔地而起，衝向在場的所有人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"吵死了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"短腿蛾子！安靜點！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"長相恐怖的怪物","speakerId":"avg_npc_1335_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（吟唱般的鳴叫）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"怪物第一時間鎖定了傷害的來源，龐大的身軀完全不影響它動作的敏捷。\n只是換了一次彈的工夫，怪物已經衝到了W面前，利牙幾乎貼到了她臉上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道……是誰把你生成這副樣子——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但想吃我，你的這張醜臉，得長得再大一點才行！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還是吃炸彈吧！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W小隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1336_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼……呼……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W小隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1336_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它……死了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"臉都炸爛了，活不了了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W小隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1336_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你、你沒事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我一向很擅長把控炸彈的距離。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W小隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1336_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我有個猜測，W。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W小隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1336_1","isRemote":false,"text":"會不會薩卡茲以前有個失落的王庭叫炸彈魔，你是炸彈魔王庭最後的公主之類的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，真好笑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W小隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1336_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這到底是什麼鬼東西？看上去可不像什麼正經動物！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W小隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1336_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我聽說哥倫比亞有些瘋子會把好幾種動物的身體縫到一塊去——該不會是他們搞的吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不巧的是，我還聽說過一批會做類似事情的薩卡茲瘋子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）有巫術的味道，赦罪師造出來的怪物嗎……為什麼會在這種荒山野嶺裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這種東西出現在這肯定不是巧合，山洞裡面應該還有別的東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W小隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1336_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我們的人，是被這個東西……吃了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就只能剖開肚子來檢查一下了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個東西，是死透了吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這傢伙還是成群的嗎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W小隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1336_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它們把洞口堵住了！W！現在怎麼辦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"逃！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"行動開始後四十八小時"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"43_g2_giantmonsterspine"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幾點了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"外面的時間對你來說還有意義嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行行好吧，就當是我的職業病，知道時間心裡會踏實點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"下午六點，離我們墜落在峽谷裡過去了兩天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……兩天。夠做很多事了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫德雷，你還記得嗎？有一次，我們三個接了一個去偷什麼薩爾貢帕夏秘寶的任務，我們偷到了東西，結果被一百來號人追殺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們躲到了一個山洞裡，也是整整兩天。餓著肚子，不敢生火，不敢出去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我還記得是伊內絲幫你縫的傷口，不然你很可能挺不過那時候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……哈哈。那時候我說，天快亮了，讓我曬會太陽吧，這樣傷好得更快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我一定阻止你了。敵人還在外面，我們不能暴露行蹤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不是你阻止我，是伊內絲取笑我。她說，疤痕商場的傭兵，居然會貪戀太陽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"疤痕商場隱藏在卡茲戴爾地區的地下，確實不見光。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"後來我當了軍事委員會的軍令長，“少校”，得到了駕駛這具骸骨的機會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"帶著那幫年輕人在卡茲戴爾和倫蒂尼姆之間穿來穿去的時候，別說曬太陽了，日光都像是被拋到我們身後。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我不可能回到過去的日子裡了。薩卡茲都回不去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……厄爾蘇拉？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼回事——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"骸骨？動起來了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"恍惚之間，巨獸骸骨彷彿重新動了起來。但很快，赫德雷意識到在動的並非神經束和骨片。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……釘子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈……船長和船，本來就是一體的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"組成“生命脊椎”的，從來就不只巨獸的遺骸，還有這一排排釘在骨架上，用來將死去的生物組織組裝成“運輸船”的長釘。\n其中有一枚，釘住了脊椎上最關鍵的一節。她的法術浸潤過它。\n她和這具骸骨，本來就已被巫術連接。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"王庭軍偵察術師的法術連接到了這具骸骨，我能感覺到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別著急，它還不會醒過來，但憑藉這一點連接，還有這枚釘子上存留的巨獸的能力，夠我離開這了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這枚釘子本來就是我的，我的骨頭和它連著呢，我就帶走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"巨獸的能力直接作用在人身上會怎麼樣呢？偶爾找回一點過去的瘋，感覺也還不錯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"脊骨在裂開……不行！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我說過，赫德雷，你會為你的選擇後悔的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不……又或者說，你會將這一切都當作歷史中避無可避的一部分？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"重劍穿刺裂隙，替代那枚掉落的長釘，堪堪撐住了脊椎最關鍵的部位。\n而只是這一瞬間，他們的囚犯就已經掙脫了鐵鍊。\n厄爾蘇拉從肋骨的碎裂處跳了出去，和骨片還有損壞的神經纖維一起，被持續不斷燃起的火光吞沒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"厄爾蘇拉！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“厄爾蘇拉”……漂泊在歷史碎片中，醉心於救人的英雄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我有沒有同你說過，這個名字可能更適合你？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"50_g17_wunderpass"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"長相恐怖的怪物","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（憤怒的嘶吼）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W小隊成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"它們到底有多少隻！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W小隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1336_1","isRemote":false,"text":"W！前面好像是死路！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也沒打算從前面逃，我只是給我的炸藥，留點空間——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"臥倒！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W小隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1336_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它們……被炸死了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"希望炸下來的那幾塊石頭夠砸碎它們的腦袋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W小隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1336_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它們為什麼會守在這裡？是在保護什麼東西嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我哪知道！你們是不是真的覺得我能和怪物聊得來？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W小隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1336_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳……所以，我們應該是真的發現了什麼不得了的東西？“吊塔”他們應該也是被這種怪物吃掉的吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“吊塔”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"別咒我……我還活著呢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你還活著！什麼情況？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“吊塔”","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"我們來這邊巡邏的時候發現這裡有個洞穴，擔心裡面有什麼密道之類的怪東西，就來檢查了一下……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“吊塔”","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"結果遇到了那幾個怪物！“輪胎”“刺盾”“螺母”全都被吃了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“吊塔”","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"剩下的人拼了命地跑，不知道為什麼那幾個怪物一點也不敢往這邊追，我們也沒法出去，結果被困到了現在！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"該死的，一會我要去把那幾個怪物的皮剝下來送給伊內絲做衣服……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們在裡面發現了什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“吊塔”","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"我看看，向那個方向走，過了那幾個蒙面死人，再往右邊的分岔，我都布置了記號——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蒙面死人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“吊塔”","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"幾具骷髏，有年月沒人動過了，大概是幾年前從倫蒂尼姆跑出來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“吊塔”","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"要說有什麼奇怪……他們都把自己的角砍了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"砍去雙角的……蒙面屍體？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“吊塔”","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，把腦袋包得密不透風，大概是哪個部族的傳統？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"媽的。不是你們瘋了，就是我瘋了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“吊塔”","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"你得罪過的老熟人？別那麼緊張，他們都死得不能再透了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"帶我去看，馬上！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"50_g17_wunderpass"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“吊塔”","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"喏，就是這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“吊塔”","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"到底怎麼了，W？我從沒見你這個樣子過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"閉嘴。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"數具屍體倚靠著洞壁，W俯下身去，仔細檢查著這幾個死去已久的人，不放過任何一處可能是線索的痕跡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“吊塔”","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"衣服下的身體都已經高度白骨化，都是重傷致死，沒什麼疑問。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“吊塔”","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"他們的遺體似乎當年就被人整理過，大概是他們的同伴？不過看這些灰塵，都已經是好幾年前的事了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“吊塔”","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，牆角還有個小祭壇，沒有巫術的痕跡，應該只是單純用來紀念的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……只有他們？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們……這些刺客怎麼會在這裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只有這裡的幾具？這附近還有沒有其他的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“吊塔”","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼意思，還該有誰？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“吊塔”","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"W！喂，W！你又發什麼瘋？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“吊塔”","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"到底怎麼回事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“吊塔”","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"刺客？W說這些人是刺客？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"50_g17_wunderpass"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼……呼……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“吊塔”","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"W，等等我們！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“吊塔”","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"這附近我們都看過了，沒其他可疑的東西——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們的衣服……我認識。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些該千刀萬剮的叛徒……他們本該死乾淨了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們在這裡，就意味著——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"該死，不可能的！簡直荒唐透頂！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W小隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1336_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……W，我聽說，特蕾西婭殿下的遺體被……從巴別塔偷走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別問我！我怎麼知道！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W小隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1336_1","isRemote":false,"text":"特蕾西婭殿下在巴別塔遇襲之後再次露面，就是在倫蒂尼姆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W小隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1336_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡……離倫蒂尼姆很近。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"閉嘴，我不需要你提醒！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W小隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1336_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接下來怎麼辦？我們是不是應該……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們回去，告訴伊內絲，戰備等級提到最高，其他的她會處理好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我，哼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要把這些年一直沒做完的事情……收拾乾淨。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wild_a"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"無角的薩卡茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1307_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有意義了，傭兵，我們之間的戰鬥毫無意義。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"無角的薩卡茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1307_1","isRemote":false,"text":"戰爭已經結束了！我們之間的生死不會對既定結果產生一絲一毫的影響！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_1343_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說沒意義就沒意義了？你手上沾著她的血！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_1343_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你，還有你的同伙，活著的那些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_1343_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會找到你們所有人，不管你們逃到什麼地方，我都會找到你們，把你們的骨頭一根根地抽出來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"無角的薩卡茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1307_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的罪孽，我比任何人都要清楚！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"無角的薩卡茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1307_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算今天沒有在這裡遇到你，我也會自己了斷自己的性命！你覺得你來動手能平息你那不值一提的憤怒的話，就動手吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"無角的薩卡茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1307_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不管怎麼樣，你來遲了，傭兵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"無角的薩卡茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1307_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你救不了她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_1343_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他媽的，給我閉嘴！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"我承認我犯過很多錯，但至少在這件事上，我絕不會犯錯。\n當年的叛徒我已經殺完了，我記得他們每個人的死法，甚至是最後的表情，但為什麼還有人會死在這？\n凱爾希說過，殿下是被赦罪師“復活”的，他們為什麼還需要一個活著的特蕾西婭？\n除了特雷西斯要冒充薩卡茲的偉大領袖的計劃，他們還有什麼打算？\n真是夠了……特雷西斯，赦罪師，我對你們的腦子裡的怪點子沒有興趣，但你們玷污了一位絕對不該玷污的人。\n所以你們每個人都得死，我發誓！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"他媽的，這究竟是什麼鬼地方？這裡還有扇門？\n給我……炸開！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"50_g6_sarkazancientruins"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳咳……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是……什麼東西……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"難以想像，狹窄的洞口連接的是這樣一個寬闊的山洞，終年不見天日的洞穴裡陰氣逼人，遍地皆是蒙塵的甲胄與武器。\n怪異的結晶體點綴在整個空間之中，熟悉又陌生的巨大紋樣從牆面一直延伸到地下，塗畫著讓人膽寒的符號。\n恍惚間，W生出一種怪異的感覺，她覺得並非是自己在打量周遭的一切，而是……這巨大的地下結構正在凝視著她。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"鐺——\n鈍器相撞的聲音響徹洞穴。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"鐺——鐺——\nW聽出來了，那是重物劈碎骨頭的聲音。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1332_1","isRemote":false,"text":"何人……造訪……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
